# Managed by dotfiles (common/.config/cron/crontab).
#
# Installed verbatim by `crontab` on every `bin/post-install` run — this
# REPLACES the whole crontab, so add jobs here rather than via `crontab -e`,
# or they'll be gone on the next setup run.
#
# No PATH= line here: crontab NAME=value assignments are literal, they don't
# expand $HOME, so gh-review-watch sets its own PATH instead.

*/15 * * * * $HOME/.bin/gh-review-watch >/dev/null 2>&1
